# Build output. The DLL was tracked until 2026-09-17; a shell extension loads
# into explorer.exe, and a prebuilt binary in the repository gives anyone who
# clones it something they cannot check against the source. Build it with
# install.bat, or publish it as a release asset.
shell-extension/quickpush.dll
shell-extension/*.o
shell-extension/*.obj
shell-extension/*.res

# resource.rc names the icon with no path, so install.bat copies it next to the
# .rc file to compile and deletes it afterwards. The one true copy is at the
# repository root.
shell-extension/quickpush.ico

# tests/run.ps1 compiles and runs this, then removes it.
tests/cmdline_test.exe
